      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OH ITS ON (8) comes off a win in the Listed Tatlow Stakes at Menangle where he had enough speed to lead from a similar barrier to this before cruising home by 13m. Highly promising and will be tough to stop though he does come up against a handy filly in SHES A DELANEY (11). Last seen when third in the Nutrien Final at Wagga in May and won two in a row prior including the Listed Pink Bonnet at Menangle. Draws on the back row but was readied with two trial wins. IM THE MAJOR (4) broke when resuming last start but still managed to finish a nose from the winner in second. Can't make any mistakes but will be fitter and has the benefit of a good draw. YOUR SHUFFLE (1) is a maiden taking on some handy rivals but her efforts have been sound and she is aided by the ace draw.",
